OL,3,AUK and EU to agree youth mobility
OL,4,Ascheme, BBC understands
OL,5,
OL,6,FUp to 100,000 young people from the EU
OL,7,Fwould be allowed to travel, work and
OL,8,Fstudy in the UK per year under a new
OL,9,Fyouth mobility scheme set to be agreed
OL,10,Fon Friday, the BBC understands.
OL,12,FThe same number of young Britons would
OL,13,Fbe allowed into Europe under the
OL,14,Fscheme, expected to be approved at the
OL,15,FUK-EU summit in Brussels. Downing
OL,16,FStreet has not commented on the
OL,17,Fdetails, but said talks were "down to
OL,18,Fthe wire" on Thursday.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
